.31,63.51],["have",63.51,63.67],["some",63.67,63.85],["time",63.85,64.27],["to",64.27,64.53],["look",64.53,64.65],["at",64.65,64.79],["questions",64.79,65.15],["one",65.15,65.61],["to",65.61,65.77],["four",65.77,66.21]]},{"start":66.71,"end":92.96,"text":"on page two. You will see that there is an example that has been done for you. On this","words":[["on",66.71,67.03],["page",67.03,67.37],["two.",67.37,67.91],["You",88.14,88.42],["will",88.42,88.58],["see",88.58,88.84],["that",88.84,89.04],["there",89.04,89.24],["is",89.24,89.4],["an",89.4,89.5],["example",89.5,90.02],["that",90.02,90.5],["has",90.5,90.62],["been",90.62,90.8],["done",90.8,91.1],["for",91.1,91.42],["you.",91.42,91.72],["On",92.38,92.78],["this",92.78,92.96]]},{"start":92.96,"end":97.14,"text":"occasion only, the conversation relating to this will be played first.","words":[["occasion",92.96,93.28],["only,",93.28,93.68],["the",94.1,94.28],["conversation",94.28,94.82],["relating",94.82,95.5],["to",95.5,95.78],["this",95.78,96.04],["will",96.04,96.24],["be",96.24,96.4],["played",96.4,96.78],["first.",96.78,97.14]]},{"start":100.75,"end":101.23,"text":"Hello.","words":[["Hello.",100.75,101.23]]},{"start":101.91,"end":103.45,"text":"Hi Susie, it's Steve.","words":[["Hi",101.91,102.35],["Susie,",102.35,102.85],["it's",103.09,103.27],["Steve.",103.27,103.45]]},{"start":103.75,"end":106.11,"text":"Steve, hi! How are you doing?","words":[["Steve,",103.75,104.19],["hi!",104.27,104.73],["How",105.39,105.59],["are",105.59,105.69],["you",105.69,105.77],["doing?",105.77,106.11]]},{"start":106.11,"end":111.99,"text":"I'm fine. Thanks. Actually, I've got to attend a conference in July in Tucson, Arizona","words":[["I'm",106.11,106.81],["fine.",106.81,107.21],["Thanks.",107.29,107.79],["Actually,",108.29,108.81],["I've",108.89,109.11],["got",109.11,109.25],["to",109.25,109.41],["attend",109.41,109.61],["a",109.61,109.73],["conference",109.73,110.13],["in",110.13,110.53],["July",110.53,110.77],["in",110.77,111.23],["Tucson,",111.23,111.63],["Arizona",111.79,111.99]]},{"start":111.99,"end":116.59,"text":"and I was hoping you could give me a few tips. You're from around there, aren't you?","words":[["and",111.99,112.97],["I",112.97,113.19],["was",113.19,113.27],["hoping",113.27,113.49],["you",113.49,113.67],["could",113.67,113.79],["give",113.79,113.93],["me",113.93,114.05],["a",114.05,114.15],["few",114.15,114.25],["tips.",114.25,114.63],["You're",115.05,115.57],["from",115.57,115.77],["around",115.77,116.03],["there,",116.03,116.25],["aren't",116.31,116.41],["you?",116.41,116.59]]},{"start":117.05,"end":123.15,"text":"I sure am. Tucson's not my hometown, though, but it's definitely worth seeing.","words":[["I",117.05,117.19],["sure",117.19,117.53],["am.",117.53,117.99],["Tucson's",119.01,119.53],["not",119.53,119.69],["my",119.69,119.91],["hometown,",119.91,120.35],["though,",120.37,120.81],["but",120.99,121.45],["it's",121.45,121.73],["definitely",121.73,122.23],["worth",122.23,122.59],["seeing.",122.59,123.15]]},{"start":124.23,"end":129.53,"text":"What's the weather like around then? Is it true it's about 40 degrees centigrade in the daytime?","words":[["What's",124.23,124.75],["the",124.75,124.87],["weather",124.87,125.07],["like",125.07,125.35],["around",125.35,125.61],["then?",125.61,125.87],["Is",126.39,126.71],["it",126.71,126.83],["true",126.83,127.03],["it's",127.03,127.23],["about",127.23,127.43],["40",127.43,128.09],["degrees",128.09,128.37],["centigrade",128.37,128.83],["in",128.83,129.19],["the",129.19,129.27],["daytime?",129.27,129.53]]},{"start":129.53,"end":135.97,"text":"That's right, and not less than 25 at night. A bit different from England in July.","words":[["That's",129.53,130.27],["right,",130.27,130.51],["and",131.09,131.25],["not",131.25,131.47],["less",131.47,131.71],["than",131.71,131.95],["25",131.95,132.57],["at",132.57,132.91],["night.",132.91,133.21],["A",133.93,134.09],["bit",134.09,134.25],["different",134.25,134.61],["from",134.61,134.85],["England",134.85,135.37],["in",135.37,135.71],["July.",135.71,135.97]]},{"start":139.72,"end":146.44,"text":"The temperature during the day will be 40 degrees, so 40 has been written in the space.","words":[["The",139.72,139.94],["temperature",139.94,140.3],["during",140.3,140.76],["the",140.76,140.94],["day",140.94,141.26],["will",141.26,141.52],["be",141.52,141.7],["40",141.7,142.08],["degrees,",142.08,142.52],["so",143.24,143.6],["40",143.6,144.58],["has",144.58,145.36],["been",145.36,145.56],["written",145.56,145.8],["in",145.8,146.02],["the",146.02,146.14],["space.",146.14,146.44]]},{"start":147.56,"end":154.88,"text":"Now we shall begin. You should answer the questions as you listen because you will not hear the recording a second time.","words":[["Now",147.56,148.06],["we",148.06,148.22],["shall",148.22,148.4],["begin.",148.4,148.74],["You",149.52,149.7],["should",149.7,149.88],["answer",149.88,150.18],["the",150.18,150.36],["questions",150.36,150.76],["as",150.76,151.24],["you",151.24,151.44],["listen",151.44,151.78],["because",151.78,152.38],["you",152.38,152.62],["will",152.62,152.74],["not",152.74,153.02],["hear",153.02,153.34],["the",153.34,153.48],["recording",153.48,153.88],["a",153.88,154.18],["second",154.18,154.42],["time.",154.42,154.88]]},{"start":155.86,"end":159.32,"text":"Listen carefully and answer questions one to four.","words":[["Listen",155.86,156.36],["carefully",156.36,156.82],["and",156.82,157.46],["answer",157.46,157.84],["questions",157.84,158.28],["one",158.28,158.76],["to",158.76,158.96],["four.",158.96,159.32]]},{"start":162.82,"end":163.36,"text":"Hello.","words":[["Hello.",162.82,163.36]]},{"start":163.96,"end":164.98,"text":"Hi, Susie.","words":[["Hi,",163.96,164.5],["Susie.",164.62,164.98]]},{"start":165.22,"end":165.6,"text":"It's Steve.","words":[["It's",165.22,165.42],["Steve.",165.42,165.6]]},{"start":165.88,"end":166.8,"text":"Steve, hi!","words":[["Steve,",165.88,166.32],["hi!",166.42,166.8]]},{"start":167.5,"end":168.28,"text":"How are you doing?","words":[["How",167.5,167.74],["are",167.74,167.82],["you",167.82,167.92],["doing?",167.92,168.28]]},{"start":168.68,"end":169.76,"text":"I'm fine, thanks.","words":[["I'm",168.68,168.96],["fine,",168.96,169.36],["thanks.",169.48,169.76]]},{"start":170.54,"end":175.64,"text":"Actually, I've got to attend a conference in July in Tucson, Arizona, and I was hoping","words":[["Actually,",170.54,170.94],["I've",171.04,171.26],["got",171.26,171.4],["to",171.4,171.54],["attend",171.54,171.76],["a",171.76,171.9],["conference",171.9,172.26],["in",172.26,172.66],["July",172.66,172.92],["in",172.92,173.38],["Tucson,",173.38,173.78],["Arizona,",173.92,174.14],["and",174.14,175.12],["I",175.12,175.32],["was",175.32,175.42],["hoping",175.42,175.64]]},{"start":175.64,"end":176.74,"text":"you could give me a few tips.","words":[["you",175.64,175.84],["could",175.84,175.94],["give",175.94,176.08],["me",176.08,176.2],["a",176.2,176.32],["few",176.32,176.4],["tips.",176.4,176.74]]},{"start":177.44,"end":178.74,"text":"You're from around there, aren't you?","words":[["You're",177.44,177.72],["from",177.72,177.9],["around",177.9,178.18],["there,",178.18,178.4],["aren't",178.46,178.54],["you?",178.54,178.74]]},{"start":179.16,"end":180.1,"text":"I sure am.","words":[["I",179.16,179.34],["sure",179.34,179.68],["am.",179.68,180.1]]},{"start":181.14,"end":185.26,"text":"Tucson's not my hometown, though, but it's definitely worth seeing.","words":[["Tucson's",181.14,181.68],["not",181.68,181.84],["my",181.84,182.04],["hometown,",182.04,182.52],["though,",182.52,182.96],["but",183.24,183.6],["it's",183.6,183.88],["definitely",183.88,184.38],["worth",184.38,184.76],["seeing.",184.76,185.26]]},{"start":186.36,"end":188.0,"text":"What's the weather like around then?","words":[["What's",186.36,186.9],["the",186.9,187.02],["weather",187.02,187.2],["like",187.2,187.5],["around",187.5,187.74],["then?",187.74,188.0]]},{"start":188.68,"end":191.68,"text":"Is it true it's about 40 degrees centigrade in the daytime?","words":[["Is",188.68,188.86],["it",188.86,188.98],["true",188.98,189.2],["it's",189.2,189.38],["about",189.38,189.58],["40",189.58,190.2],["degrees",190.2,190.54],["centigrade",190.54,190.98],["in",190.98,191.34],["the",191.34,191.42],["daytime?",191.42,191.68]]},{"start":191.68,"end":198.1,"text":"That's right, and not less than 25 at night. A bit different from England in July.","words":[["That's",191.68,192.42],["right,",192.42,192.66],["and",193.22,193.38],["not",193.38,193.6],["less",193.6,193.86],["than",193.86,194.1],["25",194.1,194.7],["at",194.7,195.06],["night.",195.06,195.38],["A",196.04,196.24],["bit",196.24,196.4],["different",196.4,196.76],["from",196.76,197.0],["England",197.0,197.5],["in",197.5,197.84],["July.",197.84,198.1]]},{"start":199.06,"end":204.72,"text":"True. I was wondering what to take with me. I won't need warm clothes then, will I?","words":[["True.",199.06,199.7],["I",200.4,200.86],["was",200.86,201.02],["wondering",201.02,201.26],["what",201.26,201.46],["to",201.46,201.6],["take",201.6,201.8],["with",201.8,202.0],["me.",202.0,202.24],["I",202.72,202.88],["won't",202.88,203.02],["need",203.02,203.2],["warm",203.2,203.58],["clothes",203.58,203.94],["then,",203.94,204.24],["will",204.38,204.46],["I?",204.46,204.72]]},{"start":205.26,"end":211.58,"text":"Well, you'll find that everywhere is air-conditioned, and it can feel quite cold sometimes,","words":[["Well,",205.26,205.58],["you'll",206.06,206.48],["find",206.48,206.82],["that",206.82,207.08],["everywhere",207.08,207.48],["is",207.48,207.9],["air",207.9,208.22],["-conditioned,",208.22,209.02],["and",209.16,209.42],["it",209.42,209.56],["can",209.56,209.86],["feel",209.86,210.2],["quite",210.2,210.52],["cold",210.52,210.94],["sometimes,",210.94,211.58]]},{"start":212.2,"end":214.34,"text":"so a jacket would be a good idea.","words":[["so",212.2,212.56],["a",212.56,212.74],["jacket",212.74,213.08],["would",213.08,213.32],["be",213.32,213.54],["a",213.54,213.66],["good",213.66,213.96],["idea.",213.96,214.34]]},{"start":215.08,"end":220.78,"text":"You might need an umbrella as well as we sometimes have thunderstorms during the day,","words":[["You",215.08,215.66],["might",215.66,215.92],["need",215.92,216.2],["an",216.2,216.34],["umbrella",216.34,216.74],["as",216.74,217.02],["well",217.02,217.4],["as",217.4,218.04],["we",218.04,218.18],["sometimes",218.18,218.6],["have",218.6,219.0],["thunderstorms",219.0,219.96],["during",219.96,220.2],["the",220.2,220.38],["day,",220.38,220.78]]},{"start":220.78,"end":224.02,"text":"but you can always pick one up when you get there.","words":[["but",220.78,221.68],["you",221.68,222.02],["can",222.02,222.2],["always",222.2,222.5],["pick",222.5,222.78],["one",222.78,223.06],["up",223.06,223.22],["when",223.22,223.42],["you",223.42,223.54],["get",223.54,223.68],["there.",223.68,224.02]]},{"start":225.02,"end":230.08,"text":"My conference is only for a couple of days, so I was wondering what I could do in Tucson.","words":[["My",225.02,225.58],["conference",225.58,225.96],["is",225.96,226.22],["only",226.22,226.44],["for",226.44,226.66],["a",226.66,226.8],["couple",226.8,226.96],["of",226.96,227.1],["days,",227.1,227.36],["so",227.84,228.08],["I",228.08,228.54],["was",228.54,228.68],["wondering",228.68,228.92],["what",228.92,229.14],["I",229.14,229.28],["could",229.28,229.38],["do",229.38,229.64],["in",229.64,229.84],["Tucson.",229.84,230.08]]},{"start":230.94,"end":233.48,"text":"Well, it's a beautiful position.","words":[["Well,",230.94,231.5],["it's",231.96,232.32],["a",232.32,232.44],["beautiful",232.44,232.78],["position.",232.78,233.48]]},{"start":234.4,"end":239.1,"text":"I'd hire a car in Tucson and then follow the trails in the desert.","words":[["I'd",234.4,234.9],["hire",234.9,235.14],["a",235.14,235.3],["car",235.3,235.68],["in",235.68,235.94],["Tucson",235.94,236.38],["and",236.38,237.12],["then",237.12,237.36],["follow",237.36,237.7],["the",237.7,237.9],["trails",237.9,238.42],["in",238.42,238.62],["the",238.62,238.72],["desert.",238.72,239.1]]},{"start":239.78,"end":242.0,"text":"Okay, I'm writing all this down.","words":[["Okay,",239.78,240.34],["I'm",240.84,241.22],["writing",241.22,241.46],["all",241.46,241.64],["this",241.64,241.74],["down.",241.74,242.0]]},{"start":242.66,"end":245.06,"text":"Any other tips? Museums and stuff?","words":[["Any",242.66,243.22],["other",243.22,243.4],["tips?",243.4,243.7],["Museums",244.26,244.76],["and",244.76,244.84],["stuff?",244.84,245.06]]},{"start":245.92,"end":248.3,"text":"Well, there are lots of museums.","words":[["Well,",245.92,246.48],["there",246.72,247.04],["are",247.04,247.3],["lots",247.3,247.62],["of",247.62,247.8],["museums.",247.8,248.3]]},{"start":248.3,"end":255.4,"text":"the usual thing like wildlife and history. But I think the most interesting is the","words":[["the",248.3,249.42],["usual",249.42,249.8],["thing",249.8,250.16],["like",250.16,250.52],["wildlife",250.52,251.04],["and",251.04,251.52],["history.",251.52,251.96],["But",252.68,253.1],["I",253.1,253.5],["think",253.5,253.68],["the",253.68,253.84],["most",253.84,254.02],["interesting",254.02,254.78],["is",254.78,255.22],["the",255.22,255.4]]},{"start":255.4,"end":264.26,"text":"Space Museum. So my advice would be to go there. Hmm, what else? Well, there are","words":[["Space",255.4,255.9],["Museum.",255.9,256.44],["So",257.1,257.52],["my",257.52,257.82],["advice",257.82,258.24],["would",258.24,258.54],["be",258.54,258.7],["to",258.7,258.86],["go",258.86,259.08],["there.",259.08,259.56],["Hmm,",260.86,261.5],["what",261.74,261.96],["else?",261.96,262.2],["Well,",263.3,263.64],["there",263.84,264.08],["are",264.08,264.26]]},{"start":264.26,"end":269.82,"text":"plenty of walks you can do. The town itself is great and there are plenty of","words":[["plenty",264.26,264.56],["of",264.56,264.78],["walks",264.78,265.18],["you",265.18,265.46],["can",265.46,265.64],["do.",265.64,265.9],["The",266.58,266.76],["town",266.76,267.06],["itself",267.06,267.38],["is",267.38,267.66],["great",267.66,268.06],["and",268.06,268.84],["there",268.84,268.98],["are",268.98,269.08],["plenty",269.08,269.58],["of",269.58,269.82]]},{"start":269.82,"end":275.32,"text":"places you can eat and drink when you get too hot and tired. Any chance of a","words":[["places",269.82,270.16],["you",270.16,270.46],["can",270.46,270.72],["eat",270.72,271.18],["and",271.18,271.5],["drink",271.5,271.96],["when",271.96,272.28],["you",272.28,272.38],["get",272.38,272.54],["too",272.54,272.76],["hot",272.76,273.12],["and",273.12,273.34],["tired.",273.34,273.82],["Any",274.34,274.7],["chance",274.7,274.98],["of",274.98,275.2],["a",275.2,275.32]]},{"start":275.32,"end":280.14,"text":"Oh, absolutely! There are loads of courses around Tucson.","words":[["Oh,",275.32,276.48],["absolutely!",276.62,277.1],["There",278.02,278.22],["are",278.22,278.34],["loads",278.34,278.72],["of",278.72,278.94],["courses",278.94,279.44],["around",279.44,279.78],["Tucson.",279.78,280.14]]},{"start":283.96,"end":291.38,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 5-10 on page 2.","words":[["Before",283.96,284.34],["you",284.34,284.58],["hear",284.58,284.84],["the",284.84,285.02],["rest",285.02,285.26],["of",285.26,285.38],["the",285.38,285.46],["conversation,",285.46,286.1],["you",286.56,286.74],["have",286.74,286.94],["some",286.94,287.14],["time",287.14,287.62],["to",287.62,287.9],["look",287.9,288.02],["at",288.02,288.16],["questions",288.16,288.54],["5",288.54,289.14],["-10",289.14,289.72],["on",289.72,290.42],["page",290.42,290.8],["2.",290.8,291.38]]},{"start":322.02,"end":325.18,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 5-10.","words":[["Now",322.02,322.3],["listen",322.3,322.58],["and",322.58,323.06],["answer",323.06,323.44],["questions",323.44,323.94],["5",323.94,324.58],["-10.",324.58,325.18]]},{"start":328.34,"end":333.62,"text":"If you've got time, why don't you visit my parents? They'd love to see you.","words":[["If",328.34,328.9],["you've",328.9,329.1],["got",329.1,329.26],["time,",329.26,329.76],["why",330.3,330.62],["don't",330.62,330.84],["you",330.84,330.92],["visit",330.92,331.12],["my",331.12,331.32],["parents?",331.32,331.82],["They'd",332.38,332.68],["love",332.68,332.82],["to",332.82,333.06],["see",333.06,333.34],["you.",333.34,333.62]]},{"start":334.14,"end":336.52,"text":"Great! Can you give me their address?","words":[["Great!",334.14,334.6],["Can",335.32,335.72],["you",335.72,335.84],["give",335.84,335.98],["me",335.98,336.1],["their",336.1,336.24],["address?",336.24,336.52]]},{"start":336.52,"end":336.7,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",336.52,336.7]]},{"start":337.28,"end":337.74,"text":"Sure.","words":[["Sure.",337.28,337.74]]},{"start":338.66,"end":346.04,"text":"They live in the town of Williams at 6073 Fearnley Drive.","words":[["They",338.66,338.94],["live",338.94,339.16],["in",339.16,339.4],["the",339.4,339.48],["town",339.48,339.8],["of",339.8,339.98],["Williams",339.98,340.46],["at",340.46,341.7],["6073",341.7,343.82],["Fearnley",343.82,345.44],["Drive.",345.44,346.04]]},{"start":346.88,"end":347.44,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",346.88,347.44]]},{"start":347.98,"end":349.18,"text":"How do you spell that?","words":[["How",347.98,348.54],["do",348.54,348.64],["you",348.64,348.7],["spell",348.7,348.88],["that?",348.88,349.18]]},{"start":350.08,"end":358.06,"text":"F-E-A-R-N-L-E-I-G-H.","words":[["F",350.08,350.52],["-E",350.52,351.16],["-A",351.16,351.72],["-R",351.72,352.56],["-N",352.56,353.4],["-L",353.4,354.68],["-E",354.68,355.38],["-I",355.38,356.22],["-G",356.22,356.92],["-H.",356.92,358.06]]},{"start":360.42,"end":363.52,"text":"6073 Fearnley Drive.","words":[["6073",360.42,361.56],["Fearnley",361.56,362.7],["Drive.",362.7,363.52]]},{"start":364.08,"end":364.74,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",364.08,364.74]]},{"start":365.46,"end":365.94,"text":"Got that.","words":[["Got",365.46,365.76],["that.",365.76,365.94]]},{"start":365.94,"end":372.94,"text":"The town's in Northern Arizona, and it's named after a hunter in the area in the early 1800s.","words":[["The",365.94,366.52],["town's",366.52,367.06],["in",367.06,367.24],["Northern",367.24,367.68],["Arizona,",367.68,368.26],["and",368.72,369.32],["it's",369.32,369.72],["named",369.72,369.96],["after",369.96,370.34],["a",370.34,370.56],["hunter",370.56,370.8],["in",370.8,371.02],["the",371.02,371.12],["area",371.12,371.46],["in",371.46,372.1],["the",372.1,372.22],["early",372.22,372.42],["1800s.",372.42,372.94]]},{"start":374.12,"end":378.14,"text":"He used to make a living shooting animals around there for their skins.","words":[["He",374.12,374.4],["used",374.4,374.6],["to",374.6,374.74],["make",374.74,374.92],["a",374.92,375.08],["living",375.08,375.34],["shooting",375.34,375.82],["animals",375.82,376.42],["around",376.42,376.84],["there",376.84,377.16],["for",377.16,377.38],["their",377.38,377.52],["skins.",377.52,378.14]]},{"start":379.0,"end":382.96,"text":"Sounds interesting. So is it full of old buildings?","words":[["Sounds",379.0,379.68],["interesting.",379.68,380.24],["So",380.9,381.2],["is",381.2,381.6],["it",381.6,381.74],["full",381.74,382.0],["of",382.0,382.2],["old",382.2,382.54],["buildings?",382.54,382.96]]},{"start":384.04,"end":389.2,"text":"Well, the post office is the oldest as it was built in 1881,","words":[["Well,",384.04,384.48],["the",384.64,385.04],["post",385.04,385.52],["office",385.52,385.92],["is",385.92,386.22],["the",386.22,386.44],["oldest",386.44,386.8],["as",386.8,387.26],["it",387.26,387.38],["was",387.38,387.54],["built",387.54,387.82],["in",387.82,388.06],["1881,",388.06,389.2]]},{"start":389.2,"end":395.8,"text":"But there was a big fire in 1901 and most of the town was burnt down.","words":[["But",389.2,390.3],["there",390.3,390.86],["was",390.86,391.04],["a",391.04,391.16],["big",391.16,391.28],["fire",391.28,391.8],["in",391.8,392.2],["1901",392.2,392.96],["and",392.96,393.88],["most"